<p>Modernized the fossil a bit. I feel he's lost some charm, but hopefully the Foundation is better represented to current standards as requested.</p>
<p>I imagined I'd still get the question &quot;Why does it get to make requests for research things?! It is a thing that doesn't get to make requests! Grr!&quot;, so I attempted to address that. It is permitted to do (strictly monitored) research because occasionally, it researches using methodologies that are either completely unknown or extensions of theories that were supposedly abandoned.</p>
<p>It may also be (again, under very strict circumstances) &quot;checked out&quot; like a tiny, outdated, and man-shaped encyclopedia to look at things from its unique perspective and offer insight. This is the accommodation made to eliminate its much-maligned formerly free-roaming nature.</p>

